title: "simpleVI: code for evaluating the default settings of variational inference software"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for evaluating the default settings of mean-field ADVI in PyMC, NumPyro,
  TensorFlow Probability and Stan (CmdStanPy) on a suite of test models.
